        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">近战武器攻击：</em>命中+4，触及5尺，单一生物。<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">命中：</em>4（1d4+2）点穿刺伤害，目标必须成功通过DC 11的体质豁免否则中毒1小时。如果豁免失败且骰值低出5或更低，则目标将在中毒持续时间内昏迷，受到伤害或其他生物用一个动作将其摇醒时也可以提前终止其昏迷效应。</p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+4]]{+4} to hit, reach 5 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 4 ([[/damage 1d4 + 2 type=piercing]]) damage, and the target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11]] saving throw or become &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 hour. If the saving throw fails by 5 or more, the target falls &amp;Reference[condition=unconscious] for the same duration, or until it takes damage or another creature uses an action to shake it awake.</p></div>",
